1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Introduction) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Readmission within 30 days is costly for hospitals and harmful for patients.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Prediction models need data from many hospitals to generalise across populations.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Legal rules often prevent hospitals from pooling patient records in one place.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Federated learning trains a shared model while each hospital keeps its own data.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (We test whether federated training can match a model trained on pooled records.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (We also measure the cost of adding differential privacy to the shared updates.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Our cohort comes from seven hospitals of very different sizes in one region.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (All analyses were approved by the ethics boards of the participating hospitals.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
endstream
