1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Methods) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Each hospital ran 5 local epochs per round for 60 rounds of federated training.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Updates were clipped to norm 1.0 and aggregated with secure summation.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (The model is a gradient-boosted ensemble distilled into a small neural network.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Features include diagnoses, length of stay, age group and prior admissions.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (The outcome is an unplanned readmission within 30 days of hospital discharge.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Pooled training on the same features serves as an upper reference model.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Each hospital held out 20% of its admissions for the final evaluation step.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (We repeated federated training with three random seeds for every setting.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
