BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Results) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Per-hospital AUROC values are listed in Table 4, which is provided as a scanned image.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (The smallest hospital, with 1,900 admissions, gained the most from federation.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Differential privacy with epsilon 8 reduced the federated AUROC to 0.75.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Calibration of the federated model was similar to that of the pooled model.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (Training finished in 11 hours of wall-clock time across all seven hospitals.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Communication per round stayed below 4 megabytes for every participating site.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Hospitals with fewer than 5,000 admissions benefited more than large hospitals.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (No hospital performed worse with the federated model than with a local model.) Tj T* ET
