1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Discussion) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Federated training nearly matched pooled training without moving patient records.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (The privacy cost of epsilon 8 may be acceptable for decision support but not for all uses.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Small hospitals gain the most, which supports regional collaboration on such models.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Our cohort covers one region, so external validation in other regions is needed.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (Scanned appendix tables should be converted to text before any automated reuse.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Future work will test personalisation layers for hospitals with unusual case mixes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Secure summation added little overhead compared with the local training time.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (Clinicians reviewed the top features and found them clinically plausible.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
